pnpm-lock.yaml
# Byte-canonical output of _sandbox/sandbox-contract/scripts/write-lock.mjs — one line per exported schema, and
# the ONLY reason the wire contract is a thing git can diff. Formatting rewrites every one of those lines, which
# fails contract-lock.test.ts and buries the handful of changed schemas a shrink declaration exists to show.
_sandbox/sandbox-contract/contract.lock.json
**/assets/js/env.js
_sandbox/sandbox/operator-templates
# Derived files whose generator owns their shape — `**/generated` matches directories, and neither of these
# lives in one. Formatting them writes a diff the next generator run reverts, and puts generated output in
# scope of a repo-wide `pnpm format` — which is how 12 MB of minified bundles once got pretty-printed into a
# 30 MB change set that was too big to hand back to the main tree.
**/*.generated.ts
docs/architecture/index.json
# The extension manifest's authoring schema, in both the copy that ships in the package and the copy the site
# serves — written by `pnpm --filter @intentic/extension-manifest schema` and checked byte-for-byte against a
# fresh generation, so a reformat here is a diff that check would then fail on.
**/intentic-extension.schema.json

